\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Source-side results for ERM, DAN-DG and SAM, with the two additional $\lambda _{\mathrm  {DG}}$ settings of the controlled study below the rule. Each cell gives accuracy / macro-F1 (\%) on the held-out validation split of that source domain. Worst is the lowest per-domain value of each metric; the weakest domain is Art Painting for every model except DAN-DG ($\lambda _{\mathrm  {DG}}=10$), where it is Cartoon. These are the only quantities available for model selection, and checkpoints were selected on mean macro-F1.}}{13}{table.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:task3_source}{{4}{13}{Source-side results for ERM, DAN-DG and SAM, with the two additional $\lambda _{\mathrm {DG}}$ settings of the controlled study below the rule. Each cell gives accuracy / macro-F1 (\%) on the held-out validation split of that source domain. Worst is the lowest per-domain value of each metric; the weakest domain is Art Painting for every model except DAN-DG ($\lambda _{\mathrm {DG}}=10$), where it is Cartoon. These are the only quantities available for model selection, and checkpoints were selected on mean macro-F1}{table.caption.13}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Sketch results and the two source-side diagnostics. Sketch accuracy and macro-F1 are measured once on the complete Sketch domain after every Task 3 configuration was frozen; $\Delta $ columns are changes relative to ERM in percentage points. Sep.\ is the held-out accuracy of a multinomial logistic-regression probe ($C=1$, 70/30 split, seed 6304) predicting Photo, Art Painting or Cartoon from frozen source-validation features; chance is 33.3\%. The sharpness proxy is measured on a fixed batch of 32 validation images per source domain (96 in total): $\mathcal  L$ is the validation cross-entropy, $\mathcal  L_{+\epsilon }$ the cross-entropy after one normalised gradient-ascent step of radius 0.05, and $\Delta _{\mathrm  {sharp}}$ their difference.}}{13}{table.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:task3_target}{{5}{13}{Sketch results and the two source-side diagnostics. Sketch accuracy and macro-F1 are measured once on the complete Sketch domain after every Task 3 configuration was frozen; $\Delta $ columns are changes relative to ERM in percentage points. Sep.\ is the held-out accuracy of a multinomial logistic-regression probe ($C=1$, 70/30 split, seed 6304) predicting Photo, Art Painting or Cartoon from frozen source-validation features; chance is 33.3\%. The sharpness proxy is measured on a fixed batch of 32 validation images per source domain (96 in total): $\mathcal L$ is the validation cross-entropy, $\mathcal L_{+\epsilon }$ the cross-entropy after one normalised gradient-ascent step of radius 0.05, and $\Delta _{\mathrm {sharp}}$ their difference}{table.caption.14}{}}
